# Interaction Appearance — a movie detail page (Skia image + blurred backdrop,
# scrolling review) with a floating sun button that toggles light/dark theme;
# while the button is held the page scales to 0.95 and a full-screen BlurView
# fades in (module-level shared value), then the theme flips on release.
# What this test covers: toggling dark and back with animations settled, a
# long hold on the button (rescale + blur held, then release), scrolling the
# review in dark mode and back, rapid toggles (blur/scale springs reversed
# mid-flight), and a toggle while the scroll is still moving.
# Button (unlabeled icon): x 338, y 776.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/interaction-appearance"
wait 2000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 30000
wait "text" "Past Lives" 30000
wait 1000
press 338 776
wait 1200
press 338 776
wait 1200
# Hold: content shrinks and blurs until release, then the theme flips.
longpress 338 776 1500
wait 1200
# Scroll the review (dark), then back up a bit.
gesture pan 200 600 0 -350 700
wait 600
swipe 200 700 200 150
wait 1200
gesture pan 200 300 0 250 700
wait 600
# Toggle while a fling is still moving.
swipe 200 700 200 200
wait 100
press 338 776
wait 1200
# Rapid toggles.
press 338 776
wait 100
press 338 776
wait 100
press 338 776
wait 100
press 338 776
wait 1500
press 338 776 --count 5 --interval-ms 120
wait 1500
wait "text" "Past Lives" 8000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 15000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
